9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\"> (아래 가,나,다 모두 충족하여야 함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; 가. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">본교 재학생</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">으로서 2개학기 이상을 이수한 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; 나. 이수성적 평점평균이 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">3.0 이상</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">인 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; 다. 학칙에 의하여 징계 받은 사실이 없는 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">2. 수학기간 : 2011학년도 1학기 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">3. 등 록 금 : 금오공과대학교 등록금 납부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">4. 신청서 제출장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">각 종합학사행정실</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">&nbsp;(※ 테크노관 학사행정실 478-7359 /디지털관 학사행정실 478-7751 /글로벌관 학사행정실 478-7598 )</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">5. 제출서류 :</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"> 타대학수학신청원 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">6. 신청학점 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">18학점 이내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">7. 수업기간 : 2011. 3. 2(수) ~ 6. 17(금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">8. 신청기한 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0033ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2011. 2. 22(화)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">9. 수강신청</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 수강신청방법 : 공주대학교 학사지원과에서 일괄 신청</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 수업시간표 확인 : 붙임 개설과목 현황 참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(담당교수란 공란인 경우 담당교수 미정)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 수강정정기간 : 2011. 3. 3(목) ~ 3. 8(화)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 21.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">수강신청 취소 및 정정은 해당 기간 내에 공주대학교 학사지원과를 방문 후</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 가능</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 82.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -82.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">10. 학점인정 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">수학기간 중 취득한 학점은 공주대학교 학칙, 학사운영규정에 의함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 82.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -82.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;( 금오공대 학사운영규정에 근거하여 성적환산하여 성적처리함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 82.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -82.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">7. 기타</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 수강신청 취소 및 정정은 공주대학교가 정한 절차에 의함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 성적은 실점(100점 만점)을 표기하여 소속 대학교로 송부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 문의사항 : 공주대학교 학사지원과 041-850-8027</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">※ 타대학 수학 신청시 유의사항</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 1. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">선수과목 이수여부를 확인</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">한 후 신청 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; 2.</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\"> \"</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">8학기차이상졸업예정자\"&nbsp; 및&nbsp; 2011학년도 2학기 타대학 편입학 예정자는 신청 불가</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 이미 이수한 교과목과 동일한 교과목의 학점은 인정하지 않음(재수강 불가)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2011. 2. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
